Rula Diya Guitar Chords with Strumming Pattern sung by Ankit Tiwari and Dhvani Bhanushali from Bollywood Hindi movie Batla House.

Strumming Pattern: D UUD UUD

[Bb]Haa aa aa [Gm]aa aa,        [Bb]Mmm mm

[Bb]Dard woh kaafi [Gm]na tha,        Jo [Eb]dard dene aa [F]ye ho
[Bb]Saansein hi bachi hain [Gm]mujhmein,        Kya [Eb]jaan lene aa [F]ye ho
[Cm]Kismat ne kyun [Gm]humko [Bb]mila diya

Humko rula diya, hum [Gm]ko rula diya,        [Bb]Phir [Eb]se aaj yaa [Cm]ra yeh [F]dil dukha diya
Hum [Bb]ko rula diya, hum [Gm]ko rula diya,        Phir [Eb]se aaj yaara yeh [F]dil dukha diya

Haa.. aan..        [Bb]]Tu juda hoke [Gm]jaane kyun mila hai
[Eb]Sab le gaya mujhme [Bb]baaki kya ra [F]ha hai
[Bb]Aise halat hai ki [Gm]Kuch kar nahi sakte
[Eb]Bin tere jeena bhi kya [F]mar bhi nahi sakte

[Cm]Ae ishq tu [Eb]ne [Gm]Kya se [Bb]kya kiya,        Humko rula diya, hum [Gm]ko rula diya
